# Frontend Conventions

## Paths
- `@/*` → `app/`, `@shared/*` → `shared/` — prefer aliases over deep relatives

## Styling
- Tailwind 3 + tokens from `app/styles.css`. The public marketing page uses `app/marketing.css`
- **Never** arbitrary palette classes (`text-emerald-500`, `bg-amber-400`)
- Use semantic tokens: `primary`, `accent`, `destructive`, `muted`, `secondary`, `foreground`, `background`, `border`, `card`, `ink`, `citrus`, `paper`
- Prefer Lucide icons
- **Mobile mandatory**: fit viewport width; no document horizontal scroll; use `min-w-0`, stacks, `.table-scroll` + `mobileCard`, and `break-words` on rich/long content (see `mobile-responsive.mdc`)

## i18n
- New UI strings → EN + ES locale files + `t('key')` via `useTranslation()`

## Forms
- Formik + Yup; submit via Redux thunks

## Logging
- UI: `app/utils/logger.ts` only (not raw `console.*`)

## Tests
- Vitest. API integration tests live in `api/**/*.test.ts` with shared `testDbCleanup` / `testHarness`
- New API routes/behavior → tests in the same PR (happy path + edge cases). See `api-testing.mdc`
- `VITEST=true` blocks live Resend/Stripe; fixtures use `@example.test` only
